{"id":"ef58afc7cc9bf1fb","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SCompClosed.md","title":"SCompClosed","display":"SCompClosed","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SCompClosed","parameters":["F","R","f","r","D","I","J","K"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SCompClosed"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>D</span><span>I</span><span>J</span><span>K</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>D</code>、<code>I</code>、<code>J</code>、<code>K</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SCompClosed F R f r D I J K)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ SModel F R f r D I J K)\n  (forall n\n    (forall xs\n      (forall a\n        (forall e\n          (forall G\n            (implies\n              (and\n                (@ Nat n)\n                (and\n                  (@ DistinctSeq xs n)\n                  (and (exists w (and (@ Omega w) (@ SeqTo xs n w))) (@ SSemRow F R f r D K a e G))))\n              (exists H\n                (exists T\n                  (exists h\n                    (and\n                      (@ App K n H)\n                      (and\n                        (in h H)\n                        (and\n                          (@ FTuples D n T)\n                          (forall ds\n                            (implies\n                            (in ds T)\n                            (iff (in ds h) (exists ee (and (@ SAssignTuple D e xs ds ee) (@ SSat F R f r D I J K ee G a)))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b6512a07a03a1637\" href=\"?note=b6512a07a03a1637\" title=\"ZFC_DistinctSeq\">DistinctSeq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"879692e175100c7e\" href=\"?note=879692e175100c7e\" title=\"ZFC_FTuples\">FTuples</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"23839d561ae443ff\" href=\"?note=23839d561ae443ff\" title=\"ZFC_SAssignTuple\">SAssignTuple</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d645c141ea336a\" href=\"?note=36d645c141ea336a\" title=\"ZFC_SModel\">SModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ed1d89172a263c0a\" href=\"?note=ed1d89172a263c0a\" title=\"ZFC_SSat\">SSat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3a631fe769edfdd5\" href=\"?note=3a631fe769edfdd5\" title=\"ZFC_SSemRow\">SSemRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location